capture-raw-mpp: encode raw frames published over a Unix socket

Add a service with the outputs of capture-v4l2-raw-mpp that takes its frames
from another process, as a dma-buf fd or as bytes on the socket. Frames are
discarded when no output has a client.

Carried as a patch until this is merged into v4l2-mpp.

